//www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\">\u003cpath d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"vlist-s\">​\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\">\u003cspan>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>，故开工集合一致。与第三问单厂可得最大利润 \u003cspan class=\"katex\">\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\u003csemantics>\u003cmrow>\u003cmfrac>\u003cmn>225\u003c/mn>\u003cmn>2\u003c/mn>\u003c/mfrac>\u003cmo>=\u003c/mo>\u003cmn>112.5\u003c/mn>\u003c/mrow>\u003cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{225}{2}=112.5\u003c/annotation>\u003c/semantics>\u003c/math>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mord\">\u003cspan class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mfrac\">\u003cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\">\u003cspan style=\"top:-2.655em;\">\u003cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003cspan class=\"mord mtight\">\u003cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan style=\"top:-3.23em;\">\u003cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan style=\"top:-3.394em;\">\u003cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003cspan class=\"mord mtight\">\u003cspan class=\"mord mtight\">225\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"vlist-s\">​\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\">\u003cspan>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"mord\">112.5\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span> 及停产0比较，117最高；只用厂2的可变成本更高且另有固定费，不会优于厂1。因此全局选两厂。给定Q阈值解决的是生产该订单的成本；销售最优还要同时计需求下的边际收入，必须比较各集合最优利润。\u003c/p>\n","notes_md":"联合决策；全局利润比较","notes_html":"\u003cp>联合决策；全局利润比较\u003c/p>\n"},{"id":"5","title":"启动费用的政策变化","prompt_md":"保持需求与可变成本不变，把F当作可变参数。求企业采用两厂方案的F范围及临界费率下的可能总量。若政府补贴启动费，说明私人利润改善和社会净收益为何不能直接等同。","prompt_html":"\u003cp>保持需求与可变成本不变，把F当作可变参数。求企业采用两厂方案的F范围及临界费率下的可能总量。若政府补贴启动费，说明私人利润改善和社会净收益为何不能直接等同。\u003c/p>\n","answer_md":"两厂条件最优总量始终$Q=9$，最大利润 $135-F$；厂1最大利润始终 $\\frac{225}{2}$。两厂更优当 $F\u003c135-\\frac{225}{2}=\\frac{45}{2}$，等号时两方案均为全局最优，分别可售$Q=9$或 $\\frac{15}{2}$；F更高只用厂1。对 $F\\le\\frac{45}{2}$，$Q=9$确满足成本开厂条件 $\\frac{81}{3}=27\\ge F$，故所报两厂方案可行且内部一致。\n\n启动补贴降低企业承担的F，可能使其跨过开工阈值，但政府补贴是财政转移，并不自动消除真实启动资源。评价社会净收益须用消费者愿付、真实生产启动成本与筹资成本核算；不能把补贴额和私人新增利润相加当作社会资源创造。","answer_html":"\u003cp>两厂条件最优总量始终\u003cspan class=\"katex\">\u003cspan class=